{"text":"正光四年九月十五日，清信優婆夷李為亡女楊氏王袖英敬造無量壽像一堪。願亡者離苦得樂，普津法界。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"王袖英","refId":null,"text":"王袖英","start":21,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無量壽","refId":null,"text":"無量壽","start":26,"end":29},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"離苦","refId":null,"text":"離苦","start":36,"end":38},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"得洛","refId":null,"text":"得樂","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法界","refId":null,"text":"法界","start":43,"end":45}]}